[{:db/id -1, :adr/id "2607061850-kotoba-lang-wasm-webcomponent-library-extraction.edn", :adr/normalization-status :raw-preserved, :adr/normalization-error "The map literal starting with :repos-edn contains 5 form(s). Map literals must contain an even number of forms.", :adr/raw-edn "{:frontmatter\n {:id \"adr-2607061850-kotoba-lang-wasm-webcomponent-library-extraction\"\n  :title \"ADR-2607061850: kototama の browser WASM AOT WebComponent PoC を kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent ライブラリへ切り出す\"\n  :status \"accepted\"\n  :date \"2026-07-06\"\n  :deciders [\"Jun Kawasaki\"]\n  :doc_type \"adr\"\n  :topic \"kotoba-lang-wasm-webcomponent-library-extraction\"\n  :authoritative true\n  :authoritative_for [\"kototama の browser WASM AOT PoC を独立ライブラリ kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent に切り出す決定\"\n                       \"kototama/web/ をそのライブラリの consumer にする(dogfooding)決定\"\n                       \"『kotoba-lang の全リポを wasm webcomponent 化する』という依頼のスコープ再定義: 既存 .cljc リポの移植ではなく新規 .kotoba ソースでの実証に絞る\"\n                       \".kotoba 拡張子が com-* 系781リポの無関係なスキーマDSLと衝突している事実の記録(是正はスコープ外)\"]\n  :supersedes []\n  :superseded_by []\n  :related [\"adr-2607061630-kototama-browser-wasm-aot-webcomponent\"]\n  :last_verified \"2026-07-06\"}\n\n :scope-findings\n {:kotoba-extension-collision {:count 781\n                                :pattern \"com-*/schema/*.kotoba\"\n                                :actual-content \"unrelated schema DSL (namespace/entity/@unique), generated by deepen_actors.py\"\n                                :conclusion \"not kotoba-lang executable source; out of scope\"}\n  :kotoba-named-repos {:examples [\"lint-kotoba\" \"kotoba-code\" \"kotoba-procedure-clj\" \"kotoba-issue-clj\" \"kotoba-ui\" \"kagitaba\" \"kotoba-ledger-clj\"]\n                        :actual-content \".cljc/.clj regular Clojure using maps/require/third-party libs\"\n                        :conclusion \"cannot be recompiled as-is; would need rewriting in the .kotoba minimal subset (no maps, no interop, no third-party libs)\"}\n  :revised-scope \"extract a reusable library first; prove usage with a brand-new small .kotoba program (examples/gcd), not by porting an existing repo\"}\n\n :decision\n {:new-repo {:name \"kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent\"\n             :visibility :public\n             :contents [\"src/kotoba-wasm-element.js (KotobaWasmElement base/factory)\"\n                        \"src/kgraph.js (kgraph-* host-import ABI browser port, moved unchanged from kototama)\"\n                        \"examples/hello (zero-import)\"\n                        \"examples/kgraph (kgraph-* host imports)\"\n                        \"examples/gcd (brand-new .kotoba program: Euclidean algorithm, real runtime recursion)\"\n                        \"test/verify-*.mjs (dependency-free Node smoke tests)\"]}\n  :kototama-refactor {:repo \"kotoba-lang/kototama\"\n                       :pr 18\n                       :change \"web/ now consumes kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent via a pinned-commit jsdelivr import instead of carrying its own copy of the hosting code\"\n                       :node-test-pattern \"fetch pinned source -> import via data: URL (no flag-free https: import() in Node)\"}\n  :manifest {:repos-edn :extra-projects \"orgs/kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent\"\n             :west-yml-entry {:name \"wasm-webcomponent\" :remote \"kotoba-lang\" :pin \"feef2632b15cdd3f71b48ecee6dc443db184b92a\"}}}\n\n :consequences\n {:positive [\"browser WASM AOT + WebComponent pattern is now a reusable library, not PoC code embedded in kototama\"\n             \"kototama dogfoods the library as its first consumer, proving it works end-to-end including CI\"\n             \"realistic scope redefinition for the 'all kotoba-lang repos' request, demonstrated via examples/gcd\"]\n  :negative [\"kse/auth/llm/evm/btc/egress/chain host-imports remain unimplemented in the browser (kgraph-* only)\"\n             \"no load-time capability/policy re-verification\"\n             \"'all kotoba-lang repos' goal is effectively pending -- no other repo has real .kotoba source; porting lint-kotoba etc. requires rewriting their logic in the minimal subset, follow-up not done here\"\n             \"the 781-file .kotoba extension collision in com-*/schema/ is not remediated by this ADR\"]}\n\n :body\n \"# ADR-2607061850: kototama の browser WASM AOT WebComponent PoC を kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent ライブラリへ切り出す\n\n**Status**: accepted (landed)\n**Date**: 2026-07-06\n**Deciders**: Jun Kawasaki\n\n## Context\n\nADR-2607061630 で kototama に browser WASM AOT + WebComponent の PoC を実装、\nfollow-up で kgraph-* host-import のブラウザ移植を追加した。オーナーから\n「kotoba-lang の全リポが wasm webcomponent で動くようライブラリ化してほしい」\nという依頼。調査の結果、com-* 系781リポの `.kotoba` ファイルは無関係な\nスキーマDSL(名前衝突)、`kotoba-*` 系他リポは全て通常の `.cljc` Clojure\n（極小サブセットに収まらない）と判明。「全リポ移植」は的外れなため、まず\nライブラリ切り出し→新規小さな `.kotoba` プログラムでの実証、に方針を絞った\n（オーナー確認済み）。\n\n## Decision\n\n1. `kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent`（新規 public リポ）を作成。\n   `KotobaWasmElement`（再利用可能な custom element base/factory）+\n   `kgraph.js`（host-import ABI 移植、無変更で移設）+ 3 examples\n   （hello/kgraph/gcd）+ Node 依存ゼロテスト。`examples/gcd` は新規に書いた\n   `.kotoba` プログラム（ユークリッドの互除法、実行時再帰）。\n2. `kototama/web/` をこのライブラリの consumer に refactor（dogfooding）。\n   独自コピーを削除し、jsdelivr 経由の pin 済み import に置換。\n3. manifest 登録（repos.edn :extra-projects + west.yml --entry）。\n\n## Consequences\n\n- (+) パターンが再利用可能ライブラリになった。kototama 自身が実証済み consumer。\n- (+) 「全リポ化」依頼への現実的なスコープ再定義を examples/gcd で実証。\n- (−) kgraph-* 以外の host-import は未実装。capability/policy のロード時\n  再検証も無し。\n- (−) 「全リポ」目標は事実上 pending（他に .kotoba 実行ソースを持つリポが無く、\n  lint-kotoba 等の移植は別途書き直しが必要）。\n- (−) `.kotoba` 拡張子衝突（781ファイル）はこの ADR では是正しない。\n\n## References\n\n- ADR-2607061630\n- kotoba-lang/wasm-webcomponent（新規リポ）\n- kotoba-lang/kototama PR #18\n- kotoba-lang/kotoba PR #284\"}\n"}]
